{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43199","headline":"古兴二首 一 · 沈徽","name":"古兴二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蔓草自细微，女萝始夭夭。\n夤缘至百尺，荣耀非一朝。\n敷色高碧岭，流芳薄丹霄。\n如何摧秀木，正爲余波漂。\n茎叶落岩迹，英蕤从风飙。\n洪柯不足恃，况乃托陵苕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈徽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43199.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43199","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}